name sponza
kind gltf
gltf assets/built/sponza/sponza.gltf
review Crytek Sponza in metres with Pestana's PBR textures. The cache cell size is 0.125 m. Look down the atrium, along the colonnade, at the curtains, and into the dark corner. Curtain and chain alpha is opaque; only the thorn and the vase plant discard. There is no specular lobe.
checkpoint atrium -13 1.8 0 yaw 1.570796
checkpoint colonnade -12 1.7 4.5 yaw 1.570796
checkpoint curtains 0 1.6 -4.5 yaw 3.141593
checkpoint dark-corner 8 1.5 3.5 yaw 2.356194 pitch -0.1
# dark-corner is dark on purpose. --check stands at the atrium.
check atrium mean 8
sun 0.25 -1 0.15 2.0 1.9 1.7
sky 0.12 0.15 0.20
# Lamps stand at least 0.7 m clear of every surface. The first set had one 7 cm
# from the hanging drape in the atrium centre and one inside its folds: the
# drape blew out, the path reference was all fireflies, and bounce flickered.
lamp -6 6 -0.4 6 4.5 3
lamp -6 3.2 4.2 3 2.5 2
lamp 5 4 -0.4 2 1.5 1.2
